      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/D'Hanis%2C_Texas",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town grew around a railroad depot 1½ miles west, later called New D'Hanis before becoming D'Hanis.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
